      "instance_name": "individual_effort_vs_systemic_barriers",
      "label": "Individual Effort vs. Systemic Barriers",
      "description": "The contrast between personal responsibility and societal structures that create unequal opportunities. This concept is central to the meme's message and requires external knowledge to interpret the irony or critique embedded in the text.",
